warning=This plugin submits your IP address and uploads your account data (skills, quests, achievement diaries, equipment, inventory and bank contents) to osrsbestinslot.com to auto-fill its calculators, keyed by a link token you paste. It can also optionally upload screenshots of your game screen as delivery proof - your trade confirmation window, and a 1-per-second series while a shop window is open - which may include other players' names and on-screen chat. That screenshot upload is off by default and must be enabled in the plugin's settings. Only enable it if you are comfortable with that data being uploaded.
